  "packageSize": 65629,
  "published": "2026-08-10T12:24:54.93Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "2.1.1: device store is a full superset registry — FirebaseUserDevice<TKey> with nullable Token, DeviceType/Browser/BrowserVersion/Os/RawUserAgent, DateTimeOffset timestamps, (UserId,DeviceId) unique and filtered-unique Token (SQL Server). IFirebaseDeviceService exposes UpsertTokenAsync (register + login capture, nullable token) and user-scoped UnregisterAsync(token,userId,reason). Supersedes the simple store shipped in 2.1.0.",
